<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upright posture, erectness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.11
			</span></i> ; of man, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				658a22
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>straightness,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμψις,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				654b5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>fixity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					223
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>rightness,</i>
			
			<i>correctness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1181
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					47c
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουσικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					655d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν ὀνομάτων ὀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					422b
				</span></i>
			 sq., etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>use of the nominative case</i> in narrative, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>, al.</div>
